{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is visible, approach it. If grabbable, grab it, perform task, else scan again.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = OpenObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
